---
// About.astro
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section id="chi-siamo" class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-brand-ivory relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Visual Storytelling -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 relative">
        <div class="relative mx-auto">
          
          <!-- Decorative Background Frame -->
          <div class="absolute -top-4 -left-4 w-full h-full border-2 border-brand-green/20 rounded-2xl -z-10 hidden sm:block"></div>
          
          <!-- Image -->
          <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-warm border border-brand-green/10">
            <img 
              src={`${base}images/about-chef.jpg`} 
              alt="Mastro pizzaiolo che impasta con passione alla Pizzeria Rainbow a Civitavecchia" 
              class="w-full h-[380px] sm:h-[460px] object-cover object-center transform hover:scale-102 transition-transform duration-500"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>

          <!-- Floating Experience Pill -->
          <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -right-4 sm:right-6 bg-brand-green text-brand-ivory p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border-2 border-brand-yellow/40 max-w-xs flex items-center gap-4">
            <div class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-yellow flex-shrink-0">
              20+
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold text-sm sm:text-base leading-tight">Anni di Passione</p>
              <p class="text-xs font-normal text-brand-ivory/80">Punto di riferimento per Civitavecchia dal 2003</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Text & Values -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col justify-center space-y-6">
        
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-terracotta">
            La Nostra Storia & Filosofia
          </span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-green leading-tight">
            Una passione autentica, <br />
            accogliente come a casa tua.
          </h2>
        </div>

        <p class="text-brand-charcoal/85 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Fondata oltre vent'anni fa nel cuore di <strong>Civitavecchia</strong>, la nostra pizzeria è nata con un obiettivo semplice e sincero: offrire a famiglie, coppie e compagnie di amici un posto informale e caldo dove gustare piatti genuini preparati con amore.
        </p>

        <p class="text-brand-charcoal/85 text-base leading-relaxed">
          Crediamo nei tempi giusti: i nostri impasti maturano lentamente per almeno 48 ore per garantirti una pizza leggera, friabile e altamente digeribile. Ma non ci fermiamo qui: per chi ama la tavola a 360°, la nostra cucina propone ogni sera anche i grandi primi della tradizione romana e succulenti tagli di carne cotti alla brace.
        </p>

        <!-- 3 Feature Highlights -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-3">
          
          <div class="bg-white/80 p-4 rounded-xl border border-brand-green/10 shadow-sm flex flex-col">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-brand-green/10 text-brand-green flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-2">
              🍕
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-green text-sm">Pizze Fragranti</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-brand-charcoal/70 mt-1">Impasti ad alta idratazione e ingredienti sempre freschi.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white/80 p-4 rounded-xl border border-brand-green/10 shadow-sm flex flex-col">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-brand-terracotta/10 text-brand-terracotta flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-2">
              🍝
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-green text-sm">Primi & Carne</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-brand-charcoal/70 mt-1">Carbonara, cacio e pepe e tagliate alla brace ardente.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white/80 p-4 rounded-xl border border-brand-green/10 shadow-sm flex flex-col">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-brand-yellow/20 text-brand-charcoal flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-2">
              ❤️
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-green text-sm">Ambiente Caldo</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-brand-charcoal/70 mt-1">Perfetto per cene con amici, compleanni e famiglie.</p>
          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Quick Call to Action in section -->
        <div class="pt-2 flex items-center gap-4">
          <a
            href="tel:0766370162"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-terracotta font-bold hover:text-[#b04630] group transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Vieni a trovarci o prenota al 0766 370162</span>
            <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>